              "value": "Wreck"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The wrecker demon makes two claw Strikes against an object (if the object is worn or held by a creature, this action gains the manipulate trait). If both Strikes hit, combine their damage for the purpose of overcoming its Hardness. These Strikes do not count toward the wrecker demon's multiple attack penalty, nor does that penalty apply to these Strikes."
